WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.340
Two empty frames: one
dark red, labelled Alec;

2
00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:06.930
one white, labelled Angel.

3
00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.650
Each man will look at
her, and see someone.

4
00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:10.970
But who?

5
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:14.780
Between them stands the real
woman, in a plain print gown.

6
00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:16.490
She matches neither.

7
00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.770
"Call me Tess," she says.

8
00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.500
One man ruins her.

9
00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.190
One abandons her.

10
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.470
So which one harms her more?

11
00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:27.920
In this mission, you'll set
the two men side by side:

12
00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:30.450
new money, and a clergyman's son.

13
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.850
You'll weigh their power
over her: wealth and gifts,

14
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.460
or education and moral judgement.

15
00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.960
And you'll look closely
at what each man sees,

16
00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:40.530
when he looks at her.

17
00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:44.140
Your mission: decide
which man harms her more.
